%% section: Deep dives
flowchart TB
    A["Viewer opens a shared file"] --> B["Permission check at the metadata tier"]
    B --> C{"Allowed?"}
    C -->|"No"| D["Deny — the CDN never sees the request"]
    C -->|"Yes"| E["Mint a short-lived signed URL"]
    E --> F["Viewer fetches from the CDN"]
    F --> G{"Access revoked a minute later?"}
    G --> H["The signed URL is still valid until it expires"]
    H --> I["Keep the TTL short, and purge the edge on revocation"]
    I --> J["Long TTL means fast, but revocation is slow — that is the trade"]
